{"4158870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Japanese Rural Life Adventure", "steam_appid": 4158870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Japanese Rural Life Adventure</i> is a relaxing slow-life simulation where you can experience the charm of traditional Japanese countryside living, all in a beautifully crafted pixel-art world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/19b48e8bfa004d5fb50d42bc480031ef.webp?t=1780156232\" width=288 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Live in the Japanese countryside surrounded by nature.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up an old house, make the yard nice, grow your own crops, and become self-sufficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f04da24917c0ecf2c851c8744739021b.poster.avif?t=1780156232\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f04da24917c0ecf2c851c8744739021b.webm?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f04da24917c0ecf2c851c8744739021b.mp4?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/a6b9019ad9ba9ae8601c126b6d62a2e9.poster.avif?t=1780156232\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/a6b9019ad9ba9ae8601c126b6d62a2e9.webm?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/a6b9019ad9ba9ae8601c126b6d62a2e9.mp4?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the cherry blossoms in the spring;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attend the festival in the summer;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eat roasted sweet potatoes in the fall; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hear the temple bell ring in winter, and then it's time for the first shrine visit of the New Year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/d3a52bf63584e61cccc8d7440c594f99.poster.avif?t=1780156232\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/d3a52bf63584e61cccc8d7440c594f99.webm?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/d3a52bf63584e61cccc8d7440c594f99.mp4?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Self-Sufficiency: Hard Work, Deep Flavor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rice --- the essential source of energy for the people in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salt, soy sauce, miso ---- seasonings no Japanese kitchen can do without.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this countryside, many things city dwellers take for granted must be made by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f4939c873da4180ac75e73d170e78030.poster.avif?t=1780156232\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f4939c873da4180ac75e73d170e78030.webm?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f4939c873da4180ac75e73d170e78030.mp4?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By standing in the kitchen or cooking around the traditional irori hearth of your heritage home,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can simulate preparing a wide variety of dishes and seasonings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food made through your own effort tastes extra special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be surprised if the game makes you hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Bring back life to the village through various events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many events unfold depending on the season, location, and time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A villager might ask you to repair an old waterwheel,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or to help reopen a shuttered candy shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your relationships with the locals and restore the liveliness the village once had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/0a717218cf8e56f0631909dfe0943f48.poster.avif?t=1780156232\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/0a717218cf8e56f0631909dfe0943f48.webm?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/0a717218cf8e56f0631909dfe0943f48.mp4?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you complete requests and interact with the villagers, you may earn useful items or unlock new areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Grow crops, gather materials, and produce goods to gradually improve your heritage home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy a wide variety of activities, including fishing and bug catching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Meet many villagers in your new hometown, help them with their troubles, and complete missions to open up new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 100 hours of total playtime packed with numerous in-game missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins as the protagonist, a newcomer from the city, starts a solitary life in an old countryside house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by clearing the overgrown weeds, cleaning the floors, and repairing the &quot;shoji&quot; paper screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the time you've completed the tutorial, you'll have learned the basics of village life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each morning, an elderly woman visits to sell daily necessities, and each afternoon, a man arrives to buy items you no longer need. Buy and sell goods as you steadily gather everything required to thrive in the village and complete your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/19b48e8bfa004d5fb50d42bc480031ef.webp?t=1780156232\" width=288 height=28 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Japanese Rural Life Adventure</i> is a relaxing slow-life simulation where you can experience the charm of traditional Japanese countryside living, all in a beautifully crafted pixel-art world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/19b48e8bfa004d5fb50d42bc480031ef.webp?t=1780156232\" width=288 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Live in the Japanese countryside surrounded by nature.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up an old house, make the yard nice, grow your own crops, and become self-sufficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f04da24917c0ecf2c851c8744739021b.poster.avif?t=1780156232\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f04da24917c0ecf2c851c8744739021b.webm?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/f04da24917c0ecf2c851c8744739021b.mp4?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/a6b9019ad9ba9ae8601c126b6d62a2e9.poster.avif?t=1780156232\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/a6b9019ad9ba9ae8601c126b6d62a2e9.webm?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158870/extras/a6b9019ad9ba9ae8601c126b6d62a2e9.mp4?t=1780156232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the cherry blossoms in the spring;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attend the festival in the summer;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eat roasted sweet potatoes in the fall; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hear the temple bell ring in winter, and then it's time for the first shrine visit of the New Year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\